<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2TI" style="id">- BUU</book>
  <para style="h">2TI - BUU</para>
  <para style="toc1">2TI - BUU</para>
  <para style="toc2">2TI - BUU</para>
  <para style="toc3">2TI - BUU</para>
  <para style="mt1">2TI - BUU</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2TI 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 1:1" />Ame Bulus nye me ngan mbe nyi ri no-u Timoti ame vren ri ndu Yeso Kristo, rimi gbengbren Izhi yosron mbu riwu nye a no wen senkpa me ngan. <verse eid="2TI 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 1:2" />Me ngan mbe nyi ri no-u a wu Timoti wu he ka ivren won. Me bre Izhi riwa a he Timbu, nga Yeso Kristo riwa a he rinkon mbu ri lo sron ri wu ran no-u sisron.<verse eid="2TI 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bitrus a tre tre ri de senkpa ri Timoti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 1:3" />Me ngiri ri Izhi riwa me hu ri sron kinklan, bibi riwa wa ti wa timbu wa ti, me sondu taka wen rimi ibrewon ri ji ri chu. <verse eid="2TI 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 1:4" />Me taka ima si wen, nga me wa meri to-u bran bran, ritu no sron won no sii. <verse eid="2TI 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 1:5" />Me taka ri kpanyɨme wen riwa wu he ri wu, bibi riwa iyi yiwen Loyis nga yiwen Afiniki, zizan me to ri a he ri wu ngawen. <verse eid="2TI 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 1:6" />Ritu nganyi me taka ri wu ri no milan ngɨzhi de riwa Izhi ka no-u ivi riwa me sa wo wu ri tu. <verse eid="2TI 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 1:7" />Izhi ran no ta sron ri sisiri ran, ama a no ta Yuu ri senkpa, ri wa nyɨme nga vu tu.<verse eid="2TI 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 1:8" />Ran ti shan ri la tre Bachi ran, ka wu tishan ri me ri wa yo wen ri tra tren, yo sron ri gbengbren Izhi wuri ban yaa ritu tre raro riwa Izhi. <verse eid="2TI 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 1:9" />Izhi kpata chuwo no ta ki he wa ma, a ran ritu kya riwa ki ti ran ama ritu ndindi ti wan nye ama ritu nyɨme nga ndindi ti wan riwa a no ta dzu ri wo Yeso Kristo ko no vi no ti, <verse eid="2TI 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 1:10" />Ama zizan a ngaran yo ta rira ritu ye Yeso Kristo nji riwa a kpata chuwo, riwa a kre gbengbren kuu nga dzu riwo tre Izhi riwa a no ta riwa a ran kre ran. <verse eid="2TI 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 1:11" />Izhi chu wen no wen me he nji ri tsro tre wan meri he nji ri ndu wan ri ndindi. <verse eid="2TI 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 1:12" />Ritu nganyi nye me so bibi yaa nyi, ama me ran ri ti shan ran, ritu me to nji riwa me kpa nyɨme ri wu nga meri to ri chachu riwa ari ye, ikya riwa me ka chuwo riwa a ri milan-u ya. <verse eid="2TI 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 1:13" />Mɨlan kpunji tre riwa me tsro-u ngiji no he gba nkon riwa wu hu, wuri son rimi yo sron nga nyɨme nga kabru tu wen ri Yeso Kristo. <verse eid="2TI 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 1:14" />Ndindi kya riwa Izhi ka dzi ri wo wen, mɨlan-u ngɨzhi ri dzon Yuu Tsitsri riwa a son rimi sron mbu.<verse eid="2TI 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 1:15" />Wu to ri wa hu Izhi wari wa wa wa he ri meme Asiya wa kɨma gon tiwen, wari kamba ri me, kau ri wa Fayijelu mba Hamojeni.<verse eid="2TI 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 1:16" />No Bachi no ti kyawa wa ndindi bran ri Onisifaras, nga wawa wa son ri ko wan wawu, ritu a si ye ri me ran sondu si dzon wen, nga a ran ti shan ri ye tre ri me ri tra tren ran. <verse eid="2TI 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 1:17" />Ama riwa Onisifaras a ye ri Roma a gra ri wa wen ara a fe wen. <verse eid="2TI 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 1:18" />No Bachi no ya ri nchon losron chachu bla tre! A wu kyuwen wu to bibi riwa a dzon wen ka me he ri gbu Afisa.<verse eid="2TI 1:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2TI 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 2:1" />Ritu ngamba, a wu Timoty riwa wu he ka vren won , vu sron ritu ndindi ti ri kabrutu riwa Kristo Yeso ngiji ye. <verse eid="2TI 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 2:2" />Bi wo wen me tsro yi tre ritu Kristo nga mgbron nji kigbu, ngamba me wa no tsro wawa wa hu Izhi itre riwa wu tsro-a ri wa hu Izhi wari wawa wu nyɨme wa nga no wawa ngawen no wa tsro nji wari. <verse eid="2TI 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 2:3" />A wu vu sron rimi so yaa bibi riwa nji ri klukpa riwa Yeso Kristo. <verse eid="2TI 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 2:4" />Inji riwa a ran he wa klukpa ran ri ti bibi kya riwa wawa wa ran he wa klukpa ran ri wati ran, ritu ari wa ran si nji ri ko wan sron. <verse eid="2TI 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 2:5" />Nghambame nji riwa ari tsutsu a ran ri tsutsu wan ran tsede a hu doka riwa wa ti ri rinɨran ri wurutsu. <verse eid="2TI 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 2:6" />Inji riwa ari tindu bran nye ari gbuchi ri ri ri mimilan. <verse eid="2TI 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 2:7" />Taka ritu kya riwa me la nyi, i wu ti Bachi ri zon-u no to kyawa wanyi iwawu.<verse eid="2TI 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 2:8" />Taka Yeso Kristo riwa wa ta-shɨme rimi kuu riwa a he gɨzhi Doda. Rinyi nye he tre riwa me tsro nji, <verse eid="2TI 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 2:9" />Ritu riwa me bla tre ndindi, me so yaa wa lo wen ri che ka nji riwa a ti kya meme. <verse eid="2TI 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 2:10" />Ritu ngamba me vu sron ri kongye ritu wawa Izhi zhu wa, no wawa ngawen no wa kpanyɨme ri Yeso Kristo wari fe kpa chuwo nga wari fe mkpen riwa a ran kre ran.<verse eid="2TI 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 2:11" />Itre nyi he njanji tre ri:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2TI 2:11">Inde ki kuu ri wu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:11">ki son ri wu ngawen,<verse eid="2TI 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 2:12" />Inde ki vu sron, ki kii ri wu ri kpanchi ngawen</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:12">inde ki kambu ri to-u,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2TI 2:12">wawu ngawen ri kawan ri ta,<verse eid="2TI 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 2:13" />Inde ki ran he ri kpa nyɨme ran,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:13">wawu ri kpa nyɨme ri ta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:13">wawu ran kawan ri ngawan ran.<verse eid="2TI 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Inji ri Ndu riwa Izhi a nyɨme wu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 2:14" />Timoti, sondu ran taka ri wawa wa hu Izhi kyawa riwa me tre nyi; fen wa ton kusi Izhi no wa ran janyu ri ngamba ritu tre, bibi janyu mba a he kuklu, nga ari no wa pisi. <verse eid="2TI 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 2:15" />Ti ndu ri senkpa wen ritu inde wu ka ngawen tsro Izhi, ari tre ri,&lt;&lt;Me chi wu ri ndu.&gt;&gt;He bibi nji ri ndu riwa ari ti ndu bran, a ran ri ti shan ri ndu wan ran nga nji riwa ari milan ndu Izhi ti. <verse eid="2TI 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 2:16" />Ama ran kabru ri wawa wa tre tre ri kuklu ran. Ritu wawa wa ti ngamba wa ran ri hu Izhi ran. <verse eid="2TI 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 2:17" />Itre mba ri shan hi kpata ran kpanji time ka njon riwa a bu. Rimi mba a he wa Filetu nga Aminayas riwa wa tsro bibi tsro nyi, <verse eid="2TI 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 2:18" />wa ka nkon ri njanji chuwo, wa tre ri itashime ka vu yiba, wa yo sron wari time-e. <verse eid="2TI 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2TI 2:19" />Kau ri ngamba me, wa nji Izhi wa he ka inchi tra riwa a ran ri chu ran ri tu nchi tra nyi Izhi ngan wɨlo tre nyi itre ri mimilan:&lt;&lt; Bachi to wawa wa he wa ma.&lt;&lt;Ngha, tre ri han wan a tre:&lt;&lt;Wawa wa tre wawa wa he wa hu Izhi no wa ka ti meme ti chuwo.&lt;&lt;<verse eid="2TI 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2TI 2:20" />Rimi nchon ko wawa wa he ri wo iri wari wa he wa vangho, wa ti wari ri zinariya nga azurfa, ama wari wa ti wa ri konkron nga azurfa ri nkon wa mkpen ri nga nvangho wari wa ti ndu ri wa, a ran he ri mkpen ran. <verse eid="2TI 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2TI 2:21" />Ri ngamba, inde nji riwa ari hu Izhi riwa a ka wa meme nkon chuwo, ari he ka nvangho riwa wa tindu ri wu rimi nkon mkpen, ison wan he ri tsitsri nga nji riko wan ri tindu ri wu ari milan son riwa ko bibi ndu ritan ye wa no no ti.<verse eid="2TI 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2TI 2:22" />A wu Timoti, ka nkon meme riwa mirinze wawa wa ti chuwo, wuri hu nkon riwa a bi, yosron, inyɨme, isi sron, wa kyawa wa nyi ran wa nji wawa wa hu Bachi ri tsitsri sron. <verse eid="2TI 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2TI 2:23" />Ran janyu ri mkpran riwa wa he ri kuklu ran. Ritu wa ngɨzhi wanyu ye. <verse eid="2TI 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2TI 2:24" />Inji riwa ari ti ndu ri Bachi a ran bi no janyu ran: Tsede, no he ri rereri ko ngaa, no he nji riwa ari to tre ri ko ngaa, nga ran vu sron ri wa nji. <verse eid="2TI 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2TI 2:25" />No he nji riwa ari tre zho ri wa kpan fu wan, ritu Izhi ri to no wa no wa ka meme ti mba chuwo, ran dzon wa no wa to kya riwa a he kpunji <verse eid="2TI 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2TI 2:26" />Ritu no sron mba no ye bubu riri wari jɨbu rimi gbengbren meme nji. Meme nji gyuru wa no wa ti kya riwa wawu ri wa.<verse eid="2TI 2:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2TI 3" />
  <para style="s">Ikre Vi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 3:1" />A wu Timoti me wa wuri to ri: Chachu kre vi nji wa so yaa bran bran. <verse eid="2TI 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 3:2" />Ritu iri wa nji wa nyɨme tumba ri kankshe, wa nyɨme nkren, wa kpo ngamba, wa tsri nji wari, wa ka wo tre wa timba, wa ran ngiri ri wawa wa ran zon wa ran, wa ran he ri Tsitsri. <verse eid="2TI 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 3:3" />Inji wanyi wa ran he ri nyɨme ri mgbron nji ran, wa ran ka meme ti ngamba don ran, wa ti che ti wari, wa ran to vu sron ri ti mbiye ran, wa sondu ran kpa sron wari ran time, <verse eid="2TI 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 3:4" />wa ka wa kpan mba reri wa kpan fu mba, wa ti kyawa ka wa ti mkpɨran, wa ran to ri a ri bru ye chan wa ran, wa ban mba ri wawa wa han ko ngaa, wa nyɨme kyawa wa meme han nyɨme Izhi, <verse eid="2TI 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 3:5" />wa ti ka wa hu Izhi, wa kamba ri gbengbren Izhi riwa ari no wa he wa hu Izhi, ran kabru tu ri bibi nji wanyi ran.<verse eid="2TI 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 3:6" />Ikya riwa ari ti bi ran kabru ri wa ran he ritu wari mba wa gyuru wari wa ri gra ri ko mba wari gyuru wa mba wawa wana wiri ran, imba wanyi wati meme ti kigbu riwa a he riwa ka wa ngiji gbre riwa a ron, wa ka sron mba yo ri meme mbiye ri sron mba, <verse eid="2TI 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 3:7" />wa mba-a wa fe tsro bla vi, ama wa ran ri to tsro ritu ndindi Kristo tinkan ran. <verse eid="2TI 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 3:8" />Sisenmu Yanis mba Yambres wa janyu ri Musa, nganyi nye wa tsro ri che, wa kamba ri kpunji tsro tre ritu Kristo, wa taka ritu meme ti kyawa, ikpa nyɨme mba he ri kuklu. <verse eid="2TI 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 3:9" />Ama wa ran hi kpata ran, ritu isentu mba ri zhuu ra bibi riwa wa Yanis mba Yanbres.<verse eid="2TI 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bulus a Fen Timoti Ton</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 3:10" />Ama a wu Timoti, wu to bibi tsro riwa me tsro nji bran, wu to bibi son riwa me son, wu to kya riwa me wa me ri ti, wu to ri me nyɨme Izhi, wu to sondu ri vu sron ri ko nji bibi tan, riwa me nyɨme ko ngaa, wu ri to ri me vu sron ri ti yaa, <verse eid="2TI 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 3:11" />Wu to ri nji wa kra wen tu wari kpa sron won time, wu to bibi kyawa riwa wa son ndu si fe wen ri Antakiya, ri Ikoiya, nga Listira, wu to ri nji ri bubu wan wa no wen yaa a ran tre mkpa riri ran, ama Bachi Yeso kpa wen chuwo ri yaa nyi iwawu. <verse eid="2TI 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 3:12" />Ko ngaa riwa ari wa ran ti kya riwa ari si Izhi sron nga riwa a he ri yosron ri Yeso Kristo wa no yaa, <verse eid="2TI 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 3:13" />ama nji wa meme ti nga wawa wa gyuru nji ri wa wa he kyari ama wa ran he kya ran, wa ti meme ti zizan nga wa ti kyawa wawa wa meme han meme, wa gyuru nji nga wari wa gyuru wa ngawen. <verse eid="2TI 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 3:14" />A wu Timoti, kukri ritu tsro riwa wu kpa, sonndu ran kpa ran nyɨme ritu kya to ri a he kpunji ritu wu to wu nyɨme ri ta wawa ki tsro-u, <verse eid="2TI 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 3:15" />Ko riwa wu he vren, wu fe tsro ri tre Izhi, riwa ari zon-u wu to ri Izhi ri kpa-u chuwo wu kpanyɨme ri Yeso Kristo. <verse eid="2TI 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 3:16" />Imbe Izhi wawu he wɨlo tre riwa Izhi yo ri tsro nji tre Izhi ki ri la nji iri ikya riwa wa ti a ran tsra ran, ran yo nji ri nkon inde wati kya riwa a ran tsra ran, ran tsro wa nji kya riwa a tsra, <verse eid="2TI 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 3:17" />ritu no nji riwa a he wa Izhi ri mɨlan son ran to ti kya riwa a he ndindi iwawu.<verse eid="2TI 3:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2TI 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 4:1" />Me bre wu ri nde Izhi nga Yeso Kristo riwa ari bla tre ri wawa wa kuu ri wawa wa he ri si nga ritu a ri bru ye ran he chu mbu, me no yi tre nyi: <verse eid="2TI 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 4:2" />No yi tre tre Izhi; mɨlan son wuri tre tre Izhi ko inde nji wa wa wari wo ko wa ran wa wari wo ran; nde nji yiwasi waka la-u yira wa ngan iwa ran ti kya tsra ran wuri ŋoron wa ri sron. <verse eid="2TI 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 4:3" />Ivi ri ye riwa nji wari wa ran wa wari wo kpunji tre ran, wa ran wa wari ti meme ti riwa isron mba ri wa no wa ti wari kagon ngamba ri wa tsro kigbu kankankan wawa wa la wa kya riwa wa wa wari wo. <verse eid="2TI 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 4:4" />Inji wa ran wa wari wo tsro ri kpunji ran, nga wo njoo wa ti wa ti mbu ran. <verse eid="2TI 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 4:5" />Ama a wu, Timoti, ran vu tu ngawen, wuri vu sron i wu so yaa, ti ndu riwa Izhi no-u ri no ti iwawu.<verse eid="2TI 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 4:6" />Me no-u tre nyi, ritu me to son won nga ndu riwa Izhi no wen ri kre nye-en, nga vi riwa me kuu ye hwɨre. <verse eid="2TI 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 4:7" />Me ti ndindi ti-e, meri kre ndu riwa Kristo no wen me ti, me son rimi yosron. <verse eid="2TI 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 4:8" />Zizan itsro tu riwa chu riwa ndindi ti ri gben wen ri shu ritu riwa me zren tsra, Bachi Kristo riwa ari bla tre ri njanji ri nji ri no wen tsrotu riwa wa chu ri nyi chachu riwa ari bla tre, a ran ame nkankshe won nye Bachi ri no wen tsrotu riwa chu nyi ran, ama ko ngaa riwa a son ri gben vi riwa Bachi ri bru ye mgbumgblume nyi.<verse eid="2TI 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ikre tre Bulus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 4:9" />Timoti chu kpa wuri ye ri me gbagbla, <verse eid="2TI 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 4:10" />Me tre rinyi ritu Dimas kawen don ran hi ri Tasalonika ritu isron wan ngan ritu kyawa wa mgbumgblume nyi, nga Titus hi ri meme Dalmatiya, nga Kizen ngawen hi ri gbu Galatiya. <verse eid="2TI 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 4:11" />Luka nye ri kankshe wan he ri me inde wu ye wu ka ngiji Marikus cha, ritu ari zon wen ti ndu won ri nyi. <verse eid="2TI 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 4:12" />Me ti Tikikus ndu hi ri Afisa. <verse eid="2TI 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 4:13" />Inde wu ye wuka ngɨzhi tsro riwa me kadon ri ko Kabus, wuri ngɨzhi mbe riwa wa ti-u ri ntan.<verse eid="2TI 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 4:14" />Iskandari riwa ari lala a kpa sron won time rimi ndu won, Bachi Yeso ri no yaa ritu meme riwa a ti. <verse eid="2TI 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 4:15" />A wu ngawen milan wu ya, ritu a ran nyɨme tre Izhi riwa ki tsro ritu Kristo ran.<verse eid="2TI 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 4:16" />Ri gbuchi riwa me hi tra ri bla tre riwa me zhuu ritu won, injo a ran ye ran hu gon won ran, ama ko ngaa a kɨma gon tiwen, me bre Izhi no ka meme ti wawa wa kɨma gon tiwen chuwo riwa. <verse eid="2TI 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 4:17" />Bachi ka kri kusan won ri bubu wan ran no wen senkpa, ritu riwa me fe senkpa meri tre tre Yeso Kristo, no wawa wa ran he nji Yahuda ran no wa wo-u, Bachi kpa wen chuwo ritu wa hi ran wuu wen ritu kpa nyɨme won. <verse eid="2TI 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 4:18" />Bachi ri kpa wen chuwo rimi kongye riwa ari wa ran kpa wen time, ran ngɨzhi wen hi ri kpanchi son wan ri shu, no ta ki gbre wu kiri no mkpen.<verse eid="2TI 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ichi Bulus ri Kremkpen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2TI 4:19" />Tre ri wa Akila mba Briskila nga wa ko Onisifaras. <verse eid="2TI 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2TI 4:20" />Aratas a son ri gbu Korantus, me ka Tarofimas don ri gbu Milatas ritu riwa a ran he ri si ran. <verse eid="2TI 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2TI 4:21" />A wu Bulus chegbla wuri ye ri ko no su no ti. Bulus ri tre riwu nga Fudens ri Linas mba kalodiya ngawen wa chi wu wawu mba.<verse eid="2TI 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2TI 4:22" />No Bachi Yeso Kristo no zon-u Timoti ran zon yi wawu mbi.<verse eid="2TI 4:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 4" />
</usx>